        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwe bamunyinane, ku cisumino mwakwata mu Mfumu yesu Yesu Kristu na ku citemwiko Mupashi Wamushilo amukwatila, ndemupapata mulengafwilishako mu bulwi mukumpepelako kuli Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulempepelako pakuti nkapusuke ku bantu ba mu Yudeya abashinakila Lesa. Mulempepelako na pakuti mu Yerusalemu bakapokelele ifyakubafwako ifyo ndebatwalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa nga alefwaya, lyena nkashukila insansa shakwisa kumwenu nkese tuushako, tukasansamuke pamo na imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa wamutende, engalaba na imwe bonse. Ameni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
